#: docs/status/hardware.md:9
msgid "实板准备与未执行项"
msgstr "Physical-board preparation and unexecuted items"

#: docs/status/hardware.md:11
msgid ""
"当前 F4 四个 Board 包的物理 HIL 均为 `not_executed`。启明 V3.1、独立核心板、 V4.1 与天空星青春版分别保留 "
"PCB、晶振、接线和装配身份；未知修订与跳线不自动补齐。"
msgstr ""
"Physical HIL for all four current F4 Board packages is `not_executed`. Qiming"
" V3.1, standalone core board, V4.1 and Sky youth edition retain separate PCB,"
" oscillator, wiring and assembly identities. Unknown revisions and jumpers "
"are not filled in automatically."

#: docs/status/hardware.md:14
msgid ""
"已有 fixture 和 station template 用于准备，不代表已经连接探针、刷写、打开串口或 采集波形。未绑定计划保持 "
"`prepared_unbound`，预算和仪器身份不得猜测。"
msgstr ""
"Existing fixtures and station templates prepare execution; they do not mean "
"probes were connected, boards flashed, serial opened or waveforms captured. "
"Unbound plans remain `prepared_unbound`; budgets and instrument identities "
"must not be guessed."

#: docs/status/hardware.md:17
msgid ""
"首次执行依次核对 PCB、电源、探针、芯片、时钟与安全输出，固定源码、resolved、 工具和同一 "
"ELF，再进行启动、UART、DMA、排空、恢复与模式专项采集。每个没有执行的 controller／mode／Board "
"继续保持未执行，失败与重试原件独立保存。"
msgstr ""
"For first execution, verify PCB, power, probe, chip, clocks and safe outputs "
"in order. Fix source, resolved output, tools and the same ELF before "
"collecting startup, UART, DMA, drain, recovery and mode-specific "
"observations. Every unexecuted controller/mode/Board stays unexecuted. "
"Preserve failure and retry originals separately."

#: docs/status/hardware.md:21
msgid ""
"测量 cycles、IRQ latency、吞吐、栈高水位、功耗和掉电行为需要真实仪器、负载与单位， 主机耗时和 ARM 链接不能替代。入口见[测量与 "
"HIL 指南](../guides/performance-hil.md) 及[资格合同](../delivery/qualification.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Measuring cycles, IRQ latency, throughput, stack high-water, power and power-"
"loss behavior needs real instruments, loads and units. Host elapsed time and "
"ARM linking cannot substitute. See the [measurement and HIL "
"guide](../guides/performance-hil.md) and [qualification "
"contract](../delivery/qualification.md)."
